  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Почтовая голубь</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Письма, посылки, доставки и еще больше...</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/page_pigeon.png\" alt=\"Pigeon\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/page_items.png\" alt=\"Items\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/page_delivery.png\" alt=\"Delivery\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/page_payback.png\" alt=\"Payback\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/page_service.png\" alt=\"Service\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/page_charred_pigeon.png\" alt=\"Charred Pigeon\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/page_structures.png\" alt=\"Service\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/page_construction.png\" alt=\"Under Construction\" width=\"1000\"> <br>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jd3qCB05vGs\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;color:#ba372a\">Мод еще не завершен, но близок к завершению</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">В текущем плане работы:</h3>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Общая доработка</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:bold\"><strong>Интеграция с Exposure</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;color:#ba372a\">Требуется обратная связь!</h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Крутые идеи и предложения всегда приветствуются! Особенно если они четко изложены и обоснованы.</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align-center\">Или что-то не так? Дайте мне знать через Discord, личные сообщения или комментарии.</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;<br>В настоящее время обратные портировки (на 1.20.1 и другие версии) не планируется.<br>Обновления к более новым версиям Minecraft приходят в случае стабильной работы мода.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord Server\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Нравится ваш мод? Ваша поддержка позволит мне продолжать работать над ним и над другими модами!</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Посмотрите другие мои моды:</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n</div>",
